{
  "schema": "fixed-envelope-hp-current-reachability-evidence-v1",
  "baseline": "Only original archived v3 geometry and native old-working-point target; prior resized candidates are historical and excluded",
  "physical_inputs_invariant": true,
  "project_sources_or_defaults_changed": false,
  "source_emission_executed": false,
  "particle_transport_executed": false,
  "wave_calculation_executed": false,
  "resistance_or_constant_power_model_used": false,
  "parent_report_sha256": "46791acce75bd23a997b2c8337471732d5163ed243cef4552854ba76e759ba41",
  "normalization_and_count_contract": [
    "Each HP retains six physical radial coils and exactly two physical turns per coil, metal .02 mm2, original poses and all original winding bounds.",
    "Each complete closed subgroup has integer N1 and one prescribed current. No point on one unbranched loop receives a different current without a return path.",
    "Gauss nodes are normalized integration samples, never additional physical turns, independently driven circuits or emitted particles.",
    "For a normalized pack split at fractional volume p, the original uniform N2*I current density is restored by I1=2*p*I and I2=2*(1-p)*I. Equal currents restore it only for p=.5.",
    "The current uniform-pack field and the actual rounded-wire CAD are different spatial resolutions. Neither may be silently relabeled as the other."
  ],
  "native_representation_findings": [
    "Simple radial and nested-coordinate partitions need twelve radial_rectangle descriptors: six in group x and six in group y, with the same archived angular datum and separate currents.",
    "The internal low-level source must use turn_count_per_coil=1 per descriptor; enclosing physical metadata must retain the parent N2. Passing N2 again would double-count the physical winding.",
    "The union of complementary cell exclusions is exactly the original occupied pack, including zero-current cells. Preserve the original full parent domain separately for provenance and material exclusion.",
    "The existing exact-axis proof can validate each complete sixfold group. Do not weaken pose, callback, finite-query, domain, source ownership or cache guards.",
    "The saved 1x1 native current calibration cannot silently become a two-circuit control. A distinct segmented source recipe must store the two current circuits, original owner and parent winding count.",
    "Nested partitions are closed homogenized paths, but the unchanged actual CAD turns do not lie on a unique common original nested fraction. That branch has no certified physical turn assignment.",
    "Arbitrary independently driven cells or currents along only one axial side require additional closed circuits/return paths or a changed conductor topology. They are not merely a finer quadrature of the same two turns."
  ],
